1284 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Internship as a Junior Architectural Designer and design visualizer at \034TataLab\035\nTashkent\054 Uzbekistan  \055 May 2025 \023 September 2025\n\nCollaborated with senior architects on conceptual designs for residential\054 commercial\054 and cultural projects\054 integrating sustainable and user\055centric approaches\056 Created detailed 3D models\054 renders\054 and presentation materials\n\n\n\nJunior Architectural Designer at \034AntiSeismic\035\nTashkent\054 Uzbekistan \055 August 2025 \055 September 2026\n\nWorked with senior architects on conceptual designs for\054 commercial\054 and cultural projects\056 Contributed to brainstorming sessions\054 offering creative input on design strategies\054 and worked closely with engineers and consultants to ensure project coherence\056\nConducted in\055depth research on innovative materials and construction methods\054 emphasizing sustainable solutions for ongoing projects\056\n\n\n\nIntern Design Visualizer and Draftsman\054 Akfa Research and Development\015\nTashkent\054 Uzbekistan \023 June 2024\015\n\nVisualization of provided design concepts\054 editing and development of design solutions\056 Work in 3D and 2D\056\015\n\n\n\nInstallation Artist\054 Central Asian University\015\nTashkent\054 Uzbekistan \023 February 2024 \023 present\056\015\n\nAs part of the project created by the university\054 each month is dedicated to a specific theme\056 My task as a co\055director of the \034Arts and Crafts Society\035 was to create and implement art works dedicated to a specific\015theme\056 Together with the team\054 we launched a large\055scale photo project\054 created\015installations and various graphic posters\056\015)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1285 0 R
     /Pg 1270 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
